      "text": "[3] A. Taparugssanagorn, A. Rabbachin, M. Hamalainen, J. Saloranta, and J. Iinatti, “A review of channel modeling for wireless body area network in wireless medical communications,” Proc. 11th Int. Symp. on Wireless Personal Multimedia Communications (WPMC’08), Lapland, Finland, FL3-1, Sept. 2008.",
